    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h3 id=\"ConfigurePrograms-1.CreatenewProgramsinOpenMRS\"><span style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-weight: bold;line-height: 1.5;\">1. </span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Create new Programs in OpenMRS</span></h3><div><div class=\"syntaxhighlighter  js\"><p><span>To configure the Programs Section for specific programs navigate to the OpenMRS module to Manage Programs. Follow the steps as shown in the image below to setup a new program.</span></p></div></div><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945598/programs%20creation%20flow.gif?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458723853336&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=365\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945598/programs%20creation%20flow.gif?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458723853336&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"47775805\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"programs creation flow.gif\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/gif\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945598\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"e6ee18a8-031b-4853-bbfb-0ac0393ec7e0\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945598/programs%20creation%20flow.gif?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458723853336&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=730 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945598/programs%20creation%20flow.gif?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458723853336&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=365 1x\"></span></span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><br/></span></p><div><h3 class=\"syntaxhighlighter nogutter  sql\" id=\"ConfigurePrograms-2.RetireaProgram\">2. Retire a Program</h3></div><p>Retiring a Program can be done through OpenMRS in the Manage Programs screen. To retire a program, select one from the list as shown below:</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945598/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-01%20at%201.21.02%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459497073185&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1132&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945598/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-01%20at%201.21.02%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459497073185&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"49545326\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-04-01 at 1.21.02 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945598\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"be8a81ab-834c-4617-b302-59f8dc5cadff\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945598/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-01%20at%201.21.02%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459497073185&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=2264&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945598/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-01%20at%201.21.02%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459497073185&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1132&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></p><p>As in this case the Dengue program is checked. </p><p>Click on the Program to open the Program detail screen. Select &quot;Yes&quot; in the drop down for &quot;Retired&quot; value. Click <em style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">Save</em> to retire the selected program.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945598/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-23%20at%2011.09.59%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458723943565&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=195\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945598/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-23%20at%2011.09.59%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458723943565&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"47775812\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2015-11-23 at 11.09.59 AM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945598\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"01219560-4ce2-4104-8478-9e4db920997c\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945598/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-23%20at%2011.09.59%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458723943565&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=390 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945598/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-23%20at%2011.09.59%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458723943565&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=195 1x\"></span></p><p>This is the screen which results after any program is retired. The retired program is struck out.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945598/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-01%20at%201.22.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459497168095&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1146&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945598/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-01%20at%201.22.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459497168095&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"49545329\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-04-01 at 1.22.34 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945598\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"5b754bd7-9f5b-49da-a362-ced70486ac3f\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945598/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-01%20at%201.22.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459497168095&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=2292&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945598/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-01%20at%201.22.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459497168095&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1146&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></span></p><h3 class=\"syntaxhighlighter nogutter  sql\" id=\"ConfigurePrograms-3.Un-retireaProgram\">3. Un-retire a Program</h3><p>It is possible to again un-retire the program by following the same process.</p><p>a. Select the program to be un-retired</p><p>b. Click on the program to navigate to the Edit Program page.</p><p>c. Change the retired value from &quot;yes&quot; to &quot;no&quot; and save. </p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><br/></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9e4f9769-17bb-4ca3-8e1e-b5067da8696b\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"6a71be86-e575-4d8d-8e0c-45b730b2ae3f\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div> <p> </p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
